# XML in the terminal's text view: coloured by grammar, and reformatted.
Output docs/media/tui-text.gif
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1100
Set Height 420
Set Padding 12
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Hide
Type "clear" Enter
Show
Type "vuwr examples/products.xml" Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "3"
Sleep 2s
Down Down Down Down
Sleep 1.5s
Type ":format"
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
